{"id":"wb-7-898","name":"平遥惠济桥","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"惠济桥 (平遥)","text":"惠济桥位于中国山西省晋中市平遥县古陶镇东城村，下东门外约300米处的惠济河上，是一座九墩联孔的石拱桥，2004年6月10日被列为山西省文物保护单位，2013年5月被列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。\n惠济桥始建于清康熙十年（1671年），桥身由石砌，全长80米，桥面稍呈弧形，宽7.4米。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%83%A0%E6%B5%8E%E6%A1%A5_(%E5%B9%B3%E9%81%A5)","revisionId":86475367,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86475367","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/3da7bad8a4e489f9caa1bccd.jpg","title":"Pingyao Huiji Qiao 2013.08.25 07-46-22.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pingyao_Huiji_Qiao_2013.08.25_07-46-22.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/20/Pingyao_Huiji_Qiao_2013.08.25_07-46-22.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"惠济桥 (平遥)","width":320,"height":213,"matchEvidence":"对应 Wikidata 条目的 P18 配图"}}